================================================================================
NOTICE OF MODIFICATION
================================================================================

This is a modified version of Victoria Launcher, not the original work. It is a fork,
and files here have been changed from the original.

Changes began in October 2026 and consist of:

  * Renaming the project to Deluge Launcher, with the application id changed from
    dev.victorialauncher to dev.delugelauncher, and the corresponding Kotlin packages,
    class names and resources renamed.
  * A new visual identity: a blue Material 3 colour scheme and a new adaptive launcher
    icon, replacing the original theme and icon.
  * Translations: ten languages plus Traditional Chinese, and an in-app language picker.
  * The navigation library was removed and replaced with an in-app router; the
    material-icons-extended dependency was removed and the handful of icons it
    provided are now drawn in this project.
  * Behaviour and performance changes to the home screen, app list, widgets, folders
    and settings, as described in the "What this fork changes" section of README.md.

The modifications are recorded in full in this repository's git history. A
user-facing summary is kept in the in-app changelog (Settings, About, Changelog).

No files carry an individual "modified" header. The notice above, together with the
commit history, is the record of modification for the project as a whole.

